---
alwaysApply: false
description: React component implementation rules for RefineUI
globs: ["packages/react/**/*.{tsx,ts}"]
---

- Functional components + hooks
- Define props with interface; avoid `any`
- Match Web Kit Figma variants and property scope exactly
- Use @refineui/tokens and componentSizes/foundationSizes only — no hardcoded design values
- Composable subcomponent API only — no convenience props
- Consider a11y: semantics, ARIA, keyboard, focus